WEBVTT

00:05:29.919 --> 00:05:31.093
They really matter.

00:05:31.117 --> 00:05:33.617
I think something's also
changing more fundamentally,

00:05:33.641 --> 00:05:35.760
and we as societies around the world

00:05:35.784 --> 00:05:38.926
are finally calling out
unacceptable behaviors

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:41.299
which for too long have been tolerated.

00:05:41.323 --> 00:05:43.014
Think of the #MeToo movement,

00:05:43.038 --> 00:05:45.815
and how sector after sector,
industry after industry,

00:05:45.839 --> 00:05:47.339
calling out perpetrators,

00:05:47.363 --> 00:05:49.228
bringing and holding them to account.

00:05:49.252 --> 00:05:51.680
It's a journey,
but we've embarked upon it.

00:05:51.704 --> 00:05:53.808
Look at what's happened
in the aid industry.

00:05:53.832 --> 00:05:55.371
Following some abuses of power,

00:05:55.395 --> 00:05:57.578
the aid industry
is now taking very seriously

00:05:57.602 --> 00:06:00.505
the safeguarding of children
across the world.